      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/{size}/2150_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-05-27T01:49:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Flight is definitely the biggest one. As such, have you noticed that there are significantly fewer flying characters in the Sentinels Comics universe than there are in most other imprints?</p><p>Wraith's biggest power (wealth) is only represented by drawing a few extra cards. Similar to Dr. Stinson's scientific genius showing up only slightly.</p><p>Not much about Scholar \"reading the lines,\" but it definitely shows him twisting them. Admittedly, this is weak on my part.</p><p>Other than that, I can't think of much.</p>",
